      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Some cured meats like salami and high-sodium foods can interact with MAOIs by affecting blood pressure, which is a serious concern. While vegetables are excellent, consistently relying on high-sodium deli meats and heavy soy sauce daily poses a risk that goes beyond just diet. It is strongly recommended that you discuss your specific dietary staples, including cured meats and soy sauce, with the healthcare provider who prescribed your MAOI. They can give you personalized, safe guidance for managing your medication and nutrition.",
      "source": "target",
